[en.FOCUS_C12_ROCKEVILLE_HARVEST_SEASON]
Rockeville Harvest Season

[en.FOCUS_C12_ROCKEVILLE_HARVEST_SEASON_desc]
Rockeville is the largest pony gathering area in the entire autonomous territory, second only to the rock farm itself. Countless ponies had previously congregated here to make a living, yet they struggled with poor law enforcement and management. Now, this area is poised to turn over a new leaf. We will transform it into a prosperous second hub, ushering in a new chapter of development and prosperity.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ROCKEVILLE_HARVEST_SEASON]
洛克维尔收获季

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ROCKEVILLE_HARVEST_SEASON_desc]
洛克维尔是除了采石农场本身以外，整个自治领最大的小马聚集区，此前无数的小马在这里聚集和谋生，却没能得到很好的治安和管理，现在，这个地区将翻开新的篇章，我们会将这里整治成一个繁荣的第二中心。

